    bare meta, `introN` fails on `?m` — the symptom).
  * After `← hasFiniteIntegral_norm_iff`, mono' sees the NORM of the norm:
    `‖(‖f x‖ : ℝ)‖` — strip it with a one-line `have h1 := by simp`
    (verified by probe: `‖(‖z‖ : ℝ)‖ = ‖z‖` is a simp fact).
